 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "We did not receive a spirit of slavery",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To fall back into the old fear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the Spirit of adoption is our guide",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Crying out in a new way",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He testifies with our own spirit",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That we are God's dear children",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And if children then we are heirs",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Co-heirs with Christ the King",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sufferings of this present time",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Are not worth comparing",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the glory that is to be",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Revealed in us all",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Creation waits with eager longing",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the revealing of sons and daughters",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Subjected to futility not by choice",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But by the one who set it",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sufferings of this present time",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Are not worth comparing",
