   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the glory that is to be",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Revealed in us all",
